    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Over 36 Years of Expertise in Taiwan 
    &lt;div id=&#34;over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1986 as Hsing Chia Enterprise, Chia Kuan has steadily built a reputation for excellence in the field of plastic injection molding. In 1996, the company expanded its capital and adopted the name Chia Kuan Co., Ltd., marking a new chapter in its journey. With more than three decades of dedicated experience, Chia Kuan has refined its production processes to deliver products that meet the highest standards of quality and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
